OpenRGB Slackware package
=========================

This package contains the OpenRGB AppDir and a small wrapper at
/usr/bin/openrgb.

The package keeps OpenRGB runtime libraries under
/usr/libexec/openrgb/OpenRGB.AppDir. It does not replace system libraries,
enable a service, or start a background process.

The package installs the OpenRGB udev rules and reloads the rules after
installation. Load the required I2C kernel modules before OpenRGB accesses
motherboard controllers.

Basic commands:

  openrgb --version
  openrgb --help
  openrgb --noautoconnect --list-devices
